# KPI Starter structure

Keep modular boundaries so new work does not re-bloat route modules / inline DEMO.

**File names: English only.** Every file and folder committed to git uses ASCII names (letters, digits, `-`, `_`, `.`). No Korean/Japanese file names; file contents may be any language.

**READMEs: English.** `README.md` files are written in English (UI terms may follow in parentheses, e.g. industry benchmarks (業界目安)).

## Layout

```
main.py                    # entry only: `uvicorn main:app` (run.sh)
sitekpi/
  app.py                   # FastAPI app, sessions, gzip, static, routers
  board/extras.py          # 8週の推移 · デバイス · 売上 · DAU (sample_extras / live_extras)
  routes/pages.py          # /, /{slug}, /live, /builder, /settings, /samples (+ /samples/preview fragment), /glossary
  routes/setup.py          # POST /setup (flow), POST /setup/industry, /setup/keep; GETs redirect to the board; board_setup()
  routes/connect.py        # /connect* — OAuth (PKCE), property, 業界パック pick
  routes/nav.py            # rail context (connected property) for every page
  selection.py             # 訪問者の行動 × 業種 in the session; composes the live board's 業界目安
  routes/flow.py           # 行動フロー: live GA4 flow (cached) + POST /flow/mapping (step → site event, per property)
  routes/benchmarks.py     # POST /benchmarks(/reset) — 自社目安 from the board's anchored popovers (static/js/popover.js)
  benchmarks.py            # pack defaults + overrides store (.data/app.sqlite3), scopes, validation
  ga4/oauth.py, ga4/data.py
  board/data.py            # build_dense_board: pack + data → board rows
  views/*.py               # view models only (dicts for templates) — NO HTML strings
  templating.py            # Jinja2 env (autoescape, t(), static_url())
  templates/
    base.html              # <head>, rail shell, blocks: title/fonts/css/main/page/scripts
    partials/              # rail, rail_nav, mobile_bar, logo, head_icons, fonts_full
    board.html, board/_macros.html, builder.html, connect.html, settings.html, home.html,
    samples.html, samples/_preview.html, glossary.html, partials/help_card.html,
    board/details.html, board/info_pops.html, board/edit_bar.html, board/drawer_step.html, board/drawer_industry.html
  packs/  i18n/  metrics/
static/
  css/   brand, rail, board, helpcard, builder, connect, settings, home, setup (編集モード parts), samples, glossary
  js/    rail.js (drawer + pack search), board.js, board_edit.js, builder.js, samples.js
  vendor/sortable-1.15.6.min.js (bundled, MIT)
```

## Where things go

| Change | Put it here | Do not |
|--------|-------------|--------|
| New industry pack | `sitekpi/packs/{slug}.py` + append to `PACK_MODULES` in `sitekpi/packs/registry.py` | Inline DEMO/BENCHMARKS in routes / `board/data.py` |
| Pack spoken labels (en/ko) | `sitekpi/i18n/pack_l10n.py` entry for that slug | Hardcode only-JP in templates |
| UI chrome strings | `sitekpi/i18n/strings.py`, used as `{{ t("key", loc) }}` | Scatter literals across templates |
| Shared KPI 説明 | `sitekpi/metrics/help.py` | Duplicate long help per pack |
| Sample nav category | `sitekpi/packs/catalog.py` + `cat.*` in `sitekpi/i18n/strings.py` | Ad-hoc category strings in rail markup |
| Board markup | `templates/board.html` + macros in `templates/board/_macros.html` | Per-industry alternate board UIs |
| 業界目安 defaults | `benchmarks` in `sitekpi/packs/{slug}.py` (shown as SiteKPI 初期値) | — |
| 業界目安 sources | `sitekpi/packs/sources.py` (verified figure = band middle; band rule labelled) | Citing a figure you haven't checked verbatim, or a different metric definition (e.g. landing-page CVR for site CVR) |
| 自社目安 (user overrides) | `sitekpi/benchmarks.py` (`load_effective`) | Reading pack BENCHMARKS directly in routes |
| Board numbers / chart points | view models in `sitekpi/views/board.py` (`_verdict` = L0, `_watch_items` = 今見るべきこと, `tabs` = L2) | Math inside templates |
| First guess of 訪問者の行動 (entry) | `selection.guess_behavior` / `ensure_selection` / `auto_notice` | Redirecting a connected user to a wizard before the board |
| Board styles / behaviour | `static/css/board.css` / `static/js/board.js` | `<style>`/`<script>` blocks in templates |
| Rail | `templates/partials/rail*.html`, `static/css/rail.css`, `static/js/rail.js`; data `views/layout.rail_context` | A second nav / top nav |
| New page | route in `routes/`, view model in `views/`, template extending `base.html`, assets in `static/` via `static_url()` | HTML/CSS built in Python |
| Data for JS | `<script type="application/json" id="…">{{ data|tojson }}</script>` | Interpolating values into JS source |

Templates autoescape: never mark user/GA4 values `|safe`. `scripts/smoke_packs.py` fails if a view builds HTML/CSS again.

## Request state (multi-user)

- Per-user state lives in `request.session` only (server-side, encrypted — `sitekpi/session.py`).
- Never keep per-request values in module globals (`global X`); use arguments or a `ContextVar`
  (see `_ACTIVE_BENCH` in `views/board.py`). Process-wide caches must be bounded + locked (`sitekpi/cache.py`).
- Never write user choices to files in the repo.

## Pack checklist (new slug)

1. `sitekpi/packs/{slug}.py` with `PACK` (`meta.category`, benchmarks, demo, copy, event_desc)
2. `PACK_MODULES` in `sitekpi/packs/registry.py`
3. `PACK_L10N[slug]` with at least `label` / `hint` for `ja` / `en` / `ko`
4. Run `python scripts/smoke_packs.py`

## Product frame (do not reopen lightly)

Same board for every pack (判定 → どこ → 詳しく); samples ≠ live; connect opens the board at once and applies 業界目安 only. Details: `kpi-starter-ux` rule.
